Not butterfly as the symbol of transformation through delicacy.

Dragon as transformation through accumulation.

It doesn’t discard what came before; it incorporates it—serpent, wings, armor, fire, intelligence, territory, myth. A composite creature made from multiple useful primitives that becomes something qualitatively different once they coexist in one body.

So the arc is less:

caterpillar → dissolution → butterfly

and more:

pieces → integration → capability stack → dragon

Not merely changed.

Recompiled.